_meanings:
A form of the first personal pronoun in the singular number used
 chiefly at the beginning of <ab>comps.</ab>; as {#madarTe#} ‘for me’, ‘for my sake’;
 {#maccitta#} ‘thinking of me’; {#madvacanam, matsaMdeSaH, matpriyam#}
 <ab>&c.</ab> <ab>&c.</ab>; {#manmanA Bava madBakto madyAjI mAM namaskuru#} <ls>Bg. 18. 65</ls>.
